      "rom_address": "0x0837A062",
      "rom_offset": "0x37A062",
      "original_english": "He died about...{WAIT}{PAGE}Oh, 6 months ago, I reckon.{CR}{LF}When I was cleaning out his{CR}{LF}place I found his will. {WAIT}{PAGE}In it, he said \"I'm leaving{CR}{LF}my farm to {VAR:21}.\"{WAIT}{PAGE}So, until whoever that is {CR}{LF}shows up, I'm taking care{CR}{LF}of the farm. {WAIT}",
